      "body": "## What\n\n`test/registered/amd/test_fp8_moe_triton_runner_with_aiter.py` enters its two runtime overrides in `setUp` with `self.enterContext(...)`. Replace both calls with the 3.10-safe `enter_scope` helper from `sglang.test.test_utils`, the same helper other tests already use.\n\n## Why\n\n`unittest.TestCase.enterContext` was added in Python 3.11. The ROCm 7.2 CI images run Python 3.10, so `setUp` raises `AttributeError: 'TestFp8MoeTritonRunnerWithAiter' object has no attribute 'enterContext'` before the test body runs. The test only runs on gfx94x with AITER, so the gfx942 rocm720 shard of `stage-b-test-1-gpu-small-amd` hits this. It started when the test was added in #44993.\n\nFailing job (rocm720, shard 3): https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39645674470/job/119380620758\n\n## Test plan\n\n- `python -m py_compile` on the changed file passes, and `black --check` is clean.\n- No GPU run locally. The test needs a gfx94x GPU with AITER.\n- Passed on MI300 (rocm720) in a dispatched `stage-b-test-1-gpu-small-amd` run: https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39824174845/job/119983188771 (`test_fp8_moe_triton_runner_with_aiter.py` ran 1 test, OK). That run used this diff cherry-picked onto main `913e91ed`, because this branch's base predates #45845 and every shard there failed at test collection.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #39819406957](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39819406957)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #39819407643](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39819407643)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #39819406948](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39819406948)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->\n",
